Package: aRchiteutis
Title: Visualise and Work with Kraken2 Metagenomics Reports
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Daniil", "Smutin", email = "dvsmutin@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Amir", "Taldaev", role = "aut"),
    person("Egor", "Lebedev", role = "aut"),
    person("Leonid", "Adonin", role = "aut"))
Description: A toolkit (formerly a loose collection of scripts, also known as
    'samovar') for parsing, transforming and visualising taxonomic composition
    tables produced by Kraken2 (and Kaiju / Bracken) metagenomics classifiers.
    It provides helpers to read classifier reports into tidy data frames,
    reshape and trim taxa, and a family of 'df2*' plotting functions covering
    composition (donut, stacked bar, box), alpha and beta diversity, ordination
    (PCA, PCoA, t-SNE), clustering, heatmaps, correlation, chord and volcano
    plots.
